 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Dog \u0026 The Detective"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "犬系警探, いぬとおまわりさん"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Retired detective Wang Minghao opened a pet store to fulfill the last wish of his fallen partner. Little did he expect that one day, after taking a nap in the store, he would wake up to find himself transformed into a large dog, with a young boy who calls himself Momotaro with origins unknown by his side! Big dog + young boy + shut-in work together to run a pet store business, unraveling the scars shut within each others' hearts and to uncover the secret behind the transformation?\n\n A heartwarming comedy that heals the soul!",
   "zh-hk": "退役刑警汪明浩為了完成殉職搭檔的遺願，開起了寵物店，怎麼想到有天在店裡午睡，醒來後發現自己竟然變身成一隻大狗，身邊還多了個自稱桃太郎的來路不明小男孩？！\n大狗狗+正太+阿宅打工仔一同經營寵物店、打開打開彼此的心結創傷，還要解開變身的秘密？療癒人心的溫馨喜劇！"
  },
